# Copy the SAME values into every duplicated frontend (.env + Vercel Production env).
# Do NOT create a new Supabase project or Resend domain for each site clone.
#
# Frontend (Vite — safe to expose in the browser):
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
#
# Optional per deployment (marketing domain only; backend stays shared):
# VITE_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-new-site.com
#
# Resend + service role live ONLY in Supabase Edge secrets (see supabase/EMAIL_SETUP.md).
# After `supabase link`, your ref is in supabase/.temp/project-ref (gitignored).
